        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Since the roots of \\( g(x) \\) are \\( r_1 - 5, r_2 - 5, r_3 - 5 \\) where \\( r_1, r_2, r_3 \\) are the roots of \\( f(x) \\), the sum of the roots of \\( g(x) \\) is:\n\\[\n(r_1 - 5) + (r_2 - 5) + (r_3 - 5) = (r_1 + r_2 + r_3) - 15\n\\]"
